                                                        "text": [
                                                            "I was awaiting \nyour arrival.",
                                                            "Our Kingdom is in\ndanger, so I task",
                                                            "you to save it \nfrom the ",
                                                            "Lynx invasion. Use\nthe secret exit",
                                                            "behind the rock in\nthe sword and bow",
