                                                            "with the hammer's\nshockwave, but you",
                                                            "cannot damage them\nwith it. If an ",
                                                            "arrow come toward \nyou, use your ",
                                                            "shield to block it",
                                                            "Your shield is \nalso very usefull",
                                                            "at pushing heavy\nobject around,",
                                                            "like stones !"
